%% UC-35 — Guided habit creation (Path A: public / Path B: study participant)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (Node.js)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant N as Neo4j
    participant M as MongoDB

    Note over F,B: On login / app start

    F->>B: GET /api/v1/study-config/me  (JWT)
    B->>M: enrollments.findOne({userId})
    M-->>B: enrollment or null
    alt enrolled
        B->>M: studies.findOne({_id: studyId})
        M-->>B: study + group config
        B-->>F: {studyId, groupId, cueConfig, activityTypeConfig,<br/>reminders (habit/questionnaire/endOfStudy/studyUpdate mode+time), autoDonate, recommenderEnabled}
    else not enrolled (public user)
        B-->>F: null
    end

    Note over F: Path A (public) or Path B (study) — same screens, different constraints

    U->>F: Tap "New Habit"
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/me/habit-config  (resolves cues from group config)
    B-->>F: {behaviorOptions, cueSource, cueCount, assignedCues, …}

    F->>U: Screen 1 — Pick behaviour (restricted if activityTypeConfig.restricted)
    U->>F: Select behaviour (e.g. "Walking")

    F->>U: Screen 2 — Enter cues (restricted if cueConfig.restricted)
    U->>F: Enter cue(s) (e.g. "After my morning coffee")

    F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/stitch-intention {action, cues, language}
    B->>AI: POST /api/v1/llm/stitch-intention {action, cues, language}
    Note over AI: Quick LLM call (temp 0.3, ~1 s) — no RAG
    AI-->>B: {sentence: "After my morning coffee, I will go for a 20-min walk."}
    B-->>F: {sentence}

    F->>U: Screen 3 — Confirm (editable sentence, duration, reminder)
    Note over F: reminders.habit.mode: off → no picker/switch; participant_choice → editable<br/>picker; admin_fixed → read-only, locked to the admin's time<br/>autoDonate → skip share toggle if true
    U->>F: Tap "Create"

    F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/intentions {behaviorKey, cues, intentionStatement, reminderTime}
    B->>M: intentions.insertOne({userId, behaviorKey, …})
    M-->>B: {id}
    B-->>F: 201 Created

    alt autoDonate = true (study group setting)
        F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/share {sentence, language}
        B->>M: enrollments.findOne({userId}) → studyId
        B->>AI: POST /api/v1/llm/classify-habit + extract-context + map-bcio
        AI-->>B: contextPhrases + mappings
        B->>N: CREATE (h:Habit {uuid, userID, studyId, sentence, …})
        N-->>B: ok
        B-->>F: 202 Accepted
    else communityShareDefault = true (public setting)
        F->>U: Show share toggle (pre-selected)
        opt User opts in
            F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/share {sentence, language}
            B->>N: CREATE (h:Habit {uuid, userID, studyId: null, …})
            N-->>B: ok
            B-->>F: 202 Accepted
        end
    end

    F->>U: Success screen
